## Interface: 120100
## Title: SpeedyBags
## Notes: Bag/bank addon with a real controller nav order and non-blocking updates.
## Author: Luna Niemitalo
## Version: 0.3.0-mvp-junk
## SavedVariables: SpeedyBagsDB
## OptionalDeps: Leatrix_Plus
## X-License: (unset)

# OptionalDeps (not a hard Dependencies) so the addon loader loads
# Leatrix_Plus first when both are enabled -- Junk.lua reads its
# _G.LeaPlusDB SavedVariables global at scan time; without this,
# load order is arbitrary and LeaPlusDB might not exist yet even when
# Leatrix_Plus is installed, silently falling back to the bare rule.
# SpeedyBags loads and works fine without Leatrix_Plus present at all.

# Interface 120100 confirmed 2026-08-16 against the installed retail client
# (/media/luna/games/World of Warcraft/_retail_/.flavor.info: Version 12.1.0.69299),
# matching references/Baganator/Baganator.toc's value.

Categories.lua
Junk.lua
Data.lua
UI.lua
SpeedyBags.lua
